{
  "_comment": [
    "ECS Fargate task definition for Directus — NO IAM ROLES variant (us-east-2).",
    "",
    "Why: the deploy user has IAMReadOnlyAccess (cannot create roles) and no",
    "ecsTaskExecutionRole exists in the account. A Fargate task can still run WITHOUT",
    "an execution role IF it (a) pulls a PUBLIC image, (b) uses no awslogs driver,",
    "(c) reads no Secrets Manager/SSM. All three hold here, so both role ARNs and the",
    "log config are removed.",
    "",
    "TWO REAL COSTS of going role-free, both temporary:",
    "  1. NO CLOUDWATCH LOGS. If Directus fails to boot (DB SSL, Redis reach), the",
    "     stopped-task view shows only an exit code — no application error. Debugging",
    "     is by iteration. Ask the admin for JUST ecsTaskExecutionRole to restore",
    "     logs; it is a far smaller ask than full IAM.",
    "  2. STORAGE_LOCATIONS=local, so uploads live on the ephemeral task filesystem",
    "     and are LOST on every task replacement. Fine for a smoke test that proves",
    "     DB + Redis connectivity; MUST become s3 (task role or access keys) before",
    "     anyone uploads a real attachment.",
    "",
    "GOAL of this variant: get Directus UP and green on the health check, proving it",
    "reaches RDS (afcoCrm) and the cluster-mode Redis. Everything else is a follow-up.",
    "",
    "Fill every CHANGE-ME and generate KEY/SECRET as stable UUIDs before registering."
  ],
  "family": "yiji-crm-directus",
  "networkMode": "awsvpc",
  "requiresCompatibilities": ["FARGATE"],
  "cpu": "1024",
  "memory": "2048",
  "containerDefinitions": [
    {
      "name": "directus",
      "image": "directus/directus:11",
      "essential": true,
      "portMappings": [
        {
          "containerPort": 8055,
          "protocol": "tcp"
        }
      ],
      "environment": [
        {
          "name": "DB_CLIENT",
          "value": "pg"
        },
        {
          "name": "DB_HOST",
          "value": "test-yiji.ctqnuieahhb8.us-east-2.rds.amazonaws.com"
        },
        {
          "name": "DB_PORT",
          "value": "5432"
        },
        {
          "name": "DB_DATABASE",
          "value": "afcoCrm"
        },
        {
          "name": "DB_USER",
          "value": "Yijicrm"
        },
        {
          "name": "DB_SSL__REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED",
          "value": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "PUBLIC_URL",
          "value": "https://api.CHANGE-ME.com"
        },
        {
          "name": "ADMIN_EMAIL",
          "value": "CHANGE-ME@example.com"
        },
        {
          "name": "WEBSOCKETS_ENABLED",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "CORS_ENABLED",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "CORS_ORIGIN",
          "value": "https://app.CHANGE-ME.com,https://admin.CHANGE-ME.com"
        },
        {
          "name": "CORS_CREDENTIALS",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_SAME_SITE",
          "value": "lax"
        },
        {
          "name": "REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_SECURE",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "STORAGE_LOCATIONS",
          "value": "local"
        },
        {
          "name": "EMAIL_TRANSPORT",
          "value": "smtp"
        },
        {
          "name": "EMAIL_FROM",
          "value": "Yiji Support <support@CHANGE-ME.com>"
        },
        {
          "name": "EMAIL_SMTP_HOST",
          "value": "CHANGE-ME"
        },
        {
          "name": "EMAIL_SMTP_PORT",
          "value": "587"
        },
        {
          "name": "EMAIL_SMTP_SECURE",
          "value": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "PASSWORD_RESET_URL_ALLOW_LIST",
          "value": "https://app.CHANGE-ME.com/reset-password,https://admin.CHANGE-ME.com/reset-password"
        },
        {
          "name": "RATE_LIMITER_ENABLED",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "CACHE_ENABLED",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "REDIS",
          "value": "redis://clustercfg.redis-yiji.6ea0wx.use2.cache.amazonaws.com:6379"
        },
        {
          "name": "RATE_LIMITER_STORE",
          "value": "redis"
        },
        {
          "name": "RATE_LIMITER_REDIS",
          "value": "redis://clustercfg.redis-yiji.6ea0wx.use2.cache.amazonaws.com:6379"
        },
        {
          "name": "CACHE_STORE",
          "value": "redis"
        },
        {
          "name": "CACHE_AUTO_PURGE",
          "value": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "DB_PASSWORD",
          "value": "CHANGE-ME-db-password"
        },
        {
          "name": "KEY",
          "value": "CHANGE-ME-uuid-stable-forever"
        },
        {
          "name": "SECRET",
          "value": "CHANGE-ME-uuid-stable-forever"
        },
        {
          "name": "ADMIN_PASSWORD",
          "value": "CHANGE-ME-strong-admin-password"
        }
      ],
      "healthCheck": {
        "command": ["CMD-SHELL", "wget -qO- http://127.0.0.1:8055/server/health || exit 1"],
        "interval": 30,
        "timeout": 5,
        "retries": 3,
        "startPeriod": 120
      }
    }
  ]
}
